[{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊……」","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我喷出来的精液沾在了小雨脸上。","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊！」","art":{"background":"a3227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"同时小雨也浑身颤抖着叫了出来。","art":{"background":"a3227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"她似乎也高潮了。","art":{"background":"a3227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「呼、呼……」","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「好浓厚的雄性气味……」","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是、是吗？」","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「或许是因为恢复了人身，本座的五感变得敏锐了」","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「把你脸弄脏了，对不起」","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"太舒服了，我没忍住。","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「别在意」","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人你想把本座弄得多脏都没关系」","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「不如说，本座更希望被你弄脏……」","art":{"background":"a3226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"}]